{"id":"repre_sentation","lemma":"représentation","pos":"noun","rank":4305,"glosses":["representation","the act or an instance of showing or presenting"],"ipa":"/ʁə.pʁe.zɑ̃.ta.sjɔ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/21/Fr-repr%C3%A9sentation.ogg/Fr-repr%C3%A9sentation.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"représentations"},"formAudio":{"représentations":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3c/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-repr%C3%A9sentations.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"À quelle heure commence cette représentation ?","en":"What time does that play start?","words":[{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"which?"},{"g":"hour, time"},{"g":"to begin, commence","l":"commencer"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null]},{"text":"Quand la représentation commence-t-elle ?","en":"When does the performance begin?","words":[{"g":"when"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to begin, commence","l":"commencer"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"she / it"}]},{"text":"Elles sont parties avant la fin de la représentation.","en":"They left before the end of the performance.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"genitals"},{"g":"before"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"end, close, finish"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[6,8,"of the"]]},{"text":"La représentation commença à 8:00.","en":"The performance began at 8:00.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to begin, commence","l":"commencer"},{"g":"to / at"}]},{"text":"La critique de la représentation de l'acteur était juste.","en":"The criticism of the actor's performance was just.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"critical"},null,null,null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"actor"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"fair, just"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"of the"]]}]}